{"date":"2026-10-04","caps":[[0.05,"Arnie Jordan here, coming to you from row three at Jordan Arena, with the Rinkside Report, the only hockey podcast with two loyal listeners."],[8.15,"Three, if my neighbour remembers. It was Sunday, October fourth."],[11.88,"I had a coffee in one hand and a pencil in the other, and I needed both, because we had three games and thirty-six goals."],[18.89,"Thirty-six. I ran out of page."],[21.31,"Game one was the Keg Canucks against Dawson's Oilers, and the Oilers put ten on the board in a ten to five win."],[27.47,"From where I sat, Ron McPherson was everywhere, with two goals and four assists for six points."],[32.76,"That's not a stat line, that's a phone number."],[35.35,"Darren Craig had a goal and four helpers, and Mike Foran scored a pair."],[39.31,"I will say there was one pass in that game that missed everybody on the ice, and I believe it is still on its way to Vineland."],[46.3,"I didn't catch who threw it, and I'm not asking."],[49.65,"But give the Canucks their due. Down seven to two, they could have packed it in."],[54.25,"Instead, Daryl Strong and Wes Short scored forty-five seconds apart to close out the second period, both set up by Waylon Tweedy and Kurt Peters, and Paul Koke had two of his own."],[64.48,"I barely had the first one written down before the second one went in."],[68.51,"The Oilers also took three trips to the penalty box and still won by five, so I'll keep my opinions to myself, at least this week."],[76.61,"Game two. I had just sat back down with a fresh coffee."],[79.56,"The ColdBreak Leafs came out flying, with goals from Kevin Pierce, Larry Penney and Adam Steele, and they led three to one after the first period."],[87.3,"I wrote the word upset in my notebook."],[89.35,"I have since crossed it out, because the Regatta Nordiques scored eight in a row."],[93.67,"Josh Moore had the hat trick and three assists, so that's six points for him as well."],[98.2,"Doug Lawrence scored twelve seconds into the third, Moore scored again less than a minute later, and that was the hockey game."],[105.54,"Nine to three for the Nordiques, with two goals each for Lawrence and Nick Langlois, and four points for Adam Regular."],[112.14,"And a tip of the cap to Kevin Rolston, who came into the Nordiques net halfway through and did not let in a single goal."],[118.86,"He made it look so easy that I started wondering if I could do it. I could not."],[123.3,"I get winded on the stairs up to row three."],[126.38,"Game three was the late one, the Culp Habs against the Timbit Senators, and the first period was a track meet."],[132.48,"Drew Hering scored forty seconds in, before I had even sharpened my pencil, and then he got another."],[138.02,"Matt Dixon added a third, and Kevin Paul set up all three of them."],[141.7,"But every time the Habs scored, the Senators answered, with Blaine Davies, then Tyler Williams, then Davies again."],[148.02,"It was tied at three after one."],[150.42,"After that, the Senators shut the door."],[152.65,"Simon Murphy scored with fifty seconds left in the second and again in the third, and Rob Holt added one for insurance, for a six to three final."],[160.81,"Davies and Murphy each had two goals and two assists, Dave Sheridan had three helpers, and Tim Shannon came in cold and stopped everything he saw."],[169.02,"Somewhere in there, a shot went so wide that it rattled the glass right in front of me."],[173.93,"I spilled half my coffee, and I would like the league to know that I am keeping the receipt."],[179.77,"And listen to this. There was not one penalty in that game."],[182.99,"Sixty minutes of oldtimers hockey, and nobody went to the box."],[186.38,"I keep a whole column in my notebook for penalties, and it is still empty. I didn't think it could be done."],[192.79,"So that's your week: thirty-six goals, two six point nights, and one game as clean as a whistle."],[197.95,"If I got your name wrong, or gave your goal to the fella beside you, take it up with the refs, the timekeeper, and how fast you people move out there."],[205.97,"All the details are on the league website."],[208.26,"Tape your sticks, and give me a wave if you see me in row three on Sunday."],[212.25,"This has been Arnie Jordan with the Rinkside Report."]],"pages":[["ROW 3 - 10/04","coffee: cold","need more pens","pencil broke"],["G1: Canucks @ Oilers","Canucks 1 - Oilers 2","McPherson 2G 4A!!","Craigy 1G 4A","Foran 2G 1A!!"],["Canucks 5 - Oilers 10  FINAL","Strong 1G","Tweedy: 2 assists","Peters: 2 assists","Koke 2G!!"],["G2: Leafs @ Nordiques","Leafs 3 - Nordiques 2","Pierce 1G","Penney 1G 1A","Steele 1G"],["Leafs 3 - Nordiques 9  FINAL","Lawrence 2G 2A!!","Langlois 2G!!","Regular 1G 3A","goalie change: Trigg"],["G3: Habs @ Sens","Habs 3 - Sens 3","Tuby 2G!!","Dixon 1G 2A","KP: 3 assists"],["Habs 3 - Sens 6  FINAL","Murphy 2G 2A!!","Holt 1G","Davies 2G 2A!!","Sheridan: 3 assists"],["Habs 3 - Sens 6  FINAL","pens: running dry","page getting full"],["THAT'S THE WEEK","note: buy more pens","stretch legs","Tape your sticks!"]],"sleeper":{"team":"TML","seed":5613},"kf":[{"t":21.31,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":1200,"h":0,"a":0,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":38.15,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":1007,"h":1,"a":0,"goal":"FORAN","final":false},{"t":43.74,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":713,"h":1,"a":1,"goal":"NEW GUY","final":false},{"t":47.4,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":521,"h":2,"a":1,"goal":"BEUKEMA","final":false},{"t":49.89,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":390,"h":3,"a":1,"goal":"MCPHERSON","final":false},{"t":52.5,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":253,"h":4,"a":1,"goal":"NOPANTS","final":false},{"t":57.31,"g":0,"per":"1","clk":0,"h":4,"a":1,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":57.33,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":1200,"h":4,"a":1,"goal":null,"final":false},{"t":60.34,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":1041,"h":5,"a":1,"goal":"GROSSI","final":false},{"t":63.06,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":898,"h":5,"a":2,"goal":"KOKE","final":false},{"t":64.03,"g":0,"per":"2","clk":740,"h":6,"a":2,"goal":"CRAIGY","final":false},{"t":64.88,"g":0,"per